# Netlify serves real files first and only falls through to these on a miss.
#
# The app has no client-side router, so this only matters for someone opening a
# bookmarked or mistyped path — send them to the app rather than a 404 page.
# 200 (rewrite), not 301: the URL must stay put so the service worker scope and
# the PWA start_url still match.
/*    /index.html   200
